                "title": "Beverly Hills Egg Knob",
                "description": "Simple in design, this Omnia 432 Egg Knobset is both elegant and timeless. What is best about this 2-1/2 inch egg knob is that it will never go out of style--a simple classic, it will look beautiful for years, no matter how many times you change the room's decor around it. The Egg Knob is available in an array of beautiful finishes.\r\n",
